  "notes": "{恥|は}ずかしがる is a godan verb formed from the adjective ⟦{恥|は}ずかしい→恥ずかしい：00843_hazukashii⟧ (embarrassed) + the suffix ⟦がる→〜がる：03089_garu⟧.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Intransitive (⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧)\n- Pattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{恥|は}ずかしがる\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{恥|は}ずかしがって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ describes someone visibly showing shyness or embarrassment at the moment.\n\nThe ⟦がる→〜がる：03089_garu⟧ suffix converts adjectives (typically い-adjectives) into verbs that describe observable behavior, particularly useful for describing third-person emotions:\n- ⟦{恥|は}ずかしい→恥ずかしい：00843_hazukashii⟧ (I feel embarrassed) → {恥|は}ずかしがる (to show embarrassment - third person)\n- ⟦{欲|ほ}しい→欲しい：01107_hoshii⟧ (I want) → {欲|ほ}し⟦がる→〜がる：03089_garu⟧ (to show wanting)\n- ⟦{寂|さび}しい→寂しい：00880_sabishii⟧ (I'm lonely) → {寂|さび}し⟦がる→〜がる：03089_garu⟧ (to show loneliness)",
